title: 'In the graph: a note is found again where a parent existed whose title predicts it.'
pid: 041e5af8-63c8-489e-9e60-b11117c24ec6
body: |2-
  Top found it in three tendings ("A reader of a plan files its
  reading well if its graph already has the place", in the team note).
  A prediction, testable from Git alone: of the notes written in
  missions, those put under a parent that existed before the mission
  are moved by a later tending less often than those put on top, or
  under a parent made in the same mission.
